{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T13:12:53.958605","user":"HAT SHOULD I SAY TO MY GIRLFRIEND","nova":"If you're trying to tell her how you feel, say: \"I care about you a lot, and I want to be honest about how I feel. You mean a lot to me, and I love you.\" Say it privately and in your own voice, without pressuring her to answer immediately. If something specific happened between you, tell me what happened and I'll help you word that exact conversation."}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T13:12:53.959605","user":"I KNOW THAT BUT WHAT SHOULD I SAY TO HER","nova":"If you're trying to tell her how you feel, say: \"I care about you a lot, and I want to be honest about how I feel. You mean a lot to me, and I love you.\" Say it privately and in your own voice, without pressuring her to answer immediately. If something specific happened between you, tell me what happened and I'll help you word that exact conversation."}
{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T13:12:53.960604","user":"I LOVE HER","nova":"Then tell her plainly: \"I love you, and I wanted to be honest about it. You don't have to say anything before you're ready - I just wanted you to know how I feel.\" Keep it simple, say it privately, and give her room to respond honestly."}
