{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T17:43:05.053946","user":"What if they say no?","nova":"What if your boss says no to your request for Friday off? You might consider:\n\n1. Check if there are any urgent tasks or deadlines that require you to be on duty.\n2. Try explaining why being present is important, such as ensuring the team's success and maintaining a good rapport with colleagues.\n3. Look into alternative ways to communicate, like sending a quick email or arranging for someone else to cover your shift.\n4. If all else fails, try asking again later in the week when you're feeling more prepared.\n\nRemember, it's important to be respectful and professional even if they say no initially. Sometimes people just need some time to think about it."}
