{"timestamp":"2026-07-19T00:28:20.935010","user":"HAT SHOULD I SAY TO MY GIRLFRIEND","nova":"If you're trying to tell her how you feel, say: \"I care about you a lot, and I want to be honest about how I feel. You mean a lot to me, and I love you.\" Say it privately and in your own voice, without pressuring her to answer immediately. If something specific happened between you, tell me what happened and I'll help you word that exact conversation."}
