{"timestamp":"2026-07-19T19:33:09.629325","user":"I LOVE HER","nova":"Then tell her plainly: \"I love you, and I wanted to be honest about it. You don't have to say anything before you're ready - I just wanted you to know how I feel.\" Keep it simple, say it privately, and give her room to respond honestly."}
